{"seq":1,"slug":"analytics-fundamentals","title":"数据分析基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-analytics-crash-reporting/analytics-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"event-tracking-design","title":"事件埋点设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-analytics-crash-reporting/analytics-fundamentals/event-tracking-design","wordCount":1564,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"user-behavior-analytics","title":"用户行为分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-analytics-crash-reporting/analytics-fundamentals/user-behavior-analytics","wordCount":1561,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"attribution-funnel","title":"归因与漏斗分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-analytics-crash-reporting/analytics-fundamentals/attribution-funnel","wordCount":1575,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"数据分析基础\">数据分析基础</h1><p>数据驱动决策的前提是&quot;数据可信且可用&quot;。本章从事件埋点的设计范式讲起——如何定义一套持久、一致、可扩展的事件分类法；进而讨论用户行为分析的核心模型（留存、路径、分群）；最后深入归因与漏斗分析，将用户从获取到转化的全链路量化。三篇文档构成移动分析的认知底座：埋点是采集层，行为分析是洞察层，归因漏斗是决策层。</p>\n"}